      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, but my doctor is super hard to get a hold of and i really dont want to pay for another urgent care visit if i dont have to. i've taken this exact dose before and it worked fine. is there like a specific reason why macrobid is bad for kidney issues or is it just a general warning? i just want to know if that dose is actually dangerous for me or not.",
